{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Sketchy Driver Demo! Only Endless Mode its available, but a whole lotta fun :D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/ebf95550c5cc64096be2d59fa20d18e4.poster.avif?t=1754416443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/ebf95550c5cc64096be2d59fa20d18e4.webm?t=1754416443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/ebf95550c5cc64096be2d59fa20d18e4.mp4?t=1754416443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Buckle up! You're a Sketchy Driver now in this rogue-lite high speed, no brakes/no rules driving game! Just pure, high-speed chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/52bb655dd1dc008a2560b6085127a90b.poster.avif?t=1754416443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/52bb655dd1dc008a2560b6085127a90b.webm?t=1754416443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/52bb655dd1dc008a2560b6085127a90b.mp4?t=1754416443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive through traffic, risk everything, launch off ramps, and pull off ridiculous mid-air tricks. All to chase that sweet, sweet high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/6f980e544e76382664876edc8ce275f1.poster.avif?t=1754416443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/6f980e544e76382664876edc8ce275f1.webm?t=1754416443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/6f980e544e76382664876edc8ce275f1.mp4?t=1754416443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think you\u2019re a bad driver? Your friends definitely do. Suck at racing games? Perfect. This is your chance to flip the script (and  the car).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/9a46bfdee939c1f7dd016f0597edb655.poster.avif?t=1754416443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/9a46bfdee939c1f7dd016f0597edb655.webm?t=1754416443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/9a46bfdee939c1f7dd016f0597edb655.mp4?t=1754416443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An endless rogue-lite driving game where the only direction is forward, and fast. Try not to die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/0089fb271aab751356f2da74db9ac7b5.poster.avif?t=1754416443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/0089fb271aab751356f2da74db9ac7b5.webm?t=1754416443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/0089fb271aab751356f2da74db9ac7b5.mp4?t=1754416443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this Demo, you can test your driving skills in 2 stages, 1 main car and a bunch of skills. <br>The full game will have more locations, more skills, more gameplay modes and more rides!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So grab the wheel and go nuts! practice to be the best and get far while we work on the full experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't forget to Wishlist!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3914010?t=1754416443","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/5400ad7502c9f9c4e52d3c05d35186a8fc51afd6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754416443","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/60ac9d25265432c18b3eb65a74b432b52666de9b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754416443","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/60ac9d25265432c18b3eb65a74b432b52666de9b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754416443","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Sketchy Driver Demo! Only Endless Mode its available, but a whole lotta fun :D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/ebf95550c5cc64096be2d59fa20d18e4.poster.avif?t=1754416443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/ebf95550c5cc64096be2d59fa20d18e4.webm?t=1754416443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/ebf95550c5cc64096be2d59fa20d18e4.mp4?t=1754416443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Buckle up! You're a Sketchy Driver now in this rogue-lite high speed, no brakes/no rules driving game! Just pure, high-speed chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/52bb655dd1dc008a2560b6085127a90b.poster.avif?t=1754416443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/52bb655dd1dc008a2560b6085127a90b.webm?t=1754416443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/52bb655dd1dc008a2560b6085127a90b.mp4?t=1754416443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive through traffic, risk everything, launch off ramps, and pull off ridiculous mid-air tricks. All to chase that sweet, sweet high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/6f980e544e76382664876edc8ce275f1.poster.avif?t=1754416443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/6f980e544e76382664876edc8ce275f1.webm?t=1754416443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/6f980e544e76382664876edc8ce275f1.mp4?t=1754416443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think you\u2019re a bad driver? Your friends definitely do. Suck at racing games? Perfect. This is your chance to flip the script (and  the car).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/9a46bfdee939c1f7dd016f0597edb655.poster.avif?t=1754416443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/9a46bfdee939c1f7dd016f0597edb655.webm?t=1754416443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/9a46bfdee939c1f7dd016f0597edb655.mp4?t=1754416443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An endless rogue-lite driving game where the only direction is forward, and fast. Try not to die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/0089fb271aab751356f2da74db9ac7b5.poster.avif?t=1754416443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/0089fb271aab751356f2da74db9ac7b5.webm?t=1754416443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/extras/0089fb271aab751356f2da74db9ac7b5.mp4?t=1754416443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this Demo, you can test your driving skills in 2 stages, 1 main car and a bunch of skills. <br>The full game will have more locations, more skills, more gameplay modes and more rides!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So grab the wheel and go nuts! practice to be the best and get far while we work on the full experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't forget to Wishlist!</p>","developers":["Gamalytix"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3544870","name":"Sketchy Driver"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914010/929034d737b84775f866203f4ee3c50ba3987855/header.jpg?t=1754416443","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requi